WEBVTT

00:15:29.246 --> 00:15:33.162
the things that's going to be really
interesting is I want to talk about care

00:15:33.162 --> 00:15:38.871
and connection are irreducible
needs when we lead,

00:15:38.871 --> 00:15:41.829
meaning we have to care for
and be connected to

00:15:41.829 --> 00:15:44.412
the people we lead are we
can't do it effectively.

00:15:44.996 --> 00:15:49.746
And up until that point, I had had so
much pushback from people like,

00:15:49.954 --> 00:15:53.121
that's bullshit. I'm not here to
like you. I'm here to lead you.

00:15:53.496 --> 00:16:00.246
And this general turned toward me and
said from the highest ranks of